{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13719","headline":"酬信州刘侍郎兄 · 顾况","name":"酬信州刘侍郎兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刘兄本知命，屈伸不介怀。\n南州管灵山，可惜旷土栖。\n樵隐同一径，竹树薄西斋。\n鸟陵嶂合杳，月配波徘徊。\n薄宦修礼数，长景谢谭谐。\n愿爲南州民，输税事鉏犁。\n胡爲走不止，风雨惊邅回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}